        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Challenge\n- People: T. J. Lavin\n- Companies: MTV\n- Products: Real World, Road Rules\n- Roles: Host, BMX rider\n\nFacts:\n- The Challenge was originally known as Road Rules: All Stars and was later titled Real World/Road Rules Challenge.\n- The Challenge is a reality game show on MTV and is spun off from the network's reality shows Real World and Road Rules.\n- Thomas Joseph \"T. J.\" Lavin was born on December 7, 1976.\n- T. J. Lavin is an American BMX rider.\n- T. J. Lavin has hosted MTV's The Challenge since its eleventh season.\n- T. J. Lavin is currently the host of The Challenge.",
